================================================================
4. CHECKER-DRIVEN DEVIATIONS (form preferred over reviewer's wording)
================================================================
- `nationality` lane forbids the token 'الصين' unless the source block names a country, and the
  Korean source blocks for 中文名 / 화교 do not. So 'الأحرف الصينية' (a#36) and 'الصينيون المقيمون في
  الخارج' (a#37) both FAILED. Adopted: 'أحرف الهان (漢字)' and 'المغتربون من أصل صيني (華僑)' —
  same meaning, no 'الصين' token. Likewise 013's language disclaimer could not list
  'اليابانية' (nationality token اليابان), so it reads 'ولا يعمل المكتب باللغة العربية'.
- `forbidden` lane matches 'رد فوري' and 'استشارة بالعربية' regardless of negation, so all the
  new disclaimers use 'ولا التزام بالرد خلال مدة معيّنة' and 'ولا يعمل المكتب باللغة العربية'
  (the wording already used in the ar guidance pack).
- `numbers` lane: 017 소형 화물차 1대 and 010 최대 1배 require the digit 1 → '(1)' / '(1 مثل)'
  retained. 003 dates use 29/5/2026 and 1/7/2026 (month digit preserved) rather than the
  word-month form.
- a#32: 'TWD 1.57M' is pinned byte-for-byte by GUIDANCE_BIO_PRESERVED_TERMS, so the Arabic
  reading was added as a gloss. No test file was modified in this lane.

